  m_Name: WorldScreenOverview
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hasSkipButton: 0
  textBoxes:
  - message: This is an overview of one of the continents. There are 6 total you'll
      need to manage. Here you can see your stationed units, what unit the continent
      is making, and when the next unit is going to arrive.
    buttonText: Ok
  - message: You can also move units here to a neighboring continent.
    buttonText: How?
  - message: Begin by selecting one or more units you want to move, then in the dropdown
      at the bottom choose which continent you want to send them to. Finally, send
      them off!
    buttonText: 
